  "overview": {
    "short": "Sacred Heart Forane Church (Malayalam: സേക്രഡ് ഹാർട്ട് ഫൊറോന പള്ളി തിരുവമ്പാടി) is a Syro-Malabar Catholic Church situated in Thiruvambady, Kozhikode District, Kerala, India.",
    "description": "Sacred Heart Forane Church (Malayalam: സേക്രഡ് ഹാർട്ട് ഫൊറോന പള്ളി തിരുവമ്പാടി) is a Syro-Malabar Catholic Church situated in Thiruvambady, Kozhikode District, Kerala, India. It is under Syro-Malabar Catholic Diocese of Thamarassery and Archdiocese of Thalassery. The Church was established in the year 1944. There are more than catholic 1000 families in this forane and about 5000 members, which is one of the largest parishes in the Diocese.",
